# Normalize all text to LF in the repo, regardless of editor/OS (WSL + Windows
# tooling was rewriting files to CRLF and churning every diff). Binary assets
# are marked so git never touches their bytes.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
